
        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-6

OVERVIEW

    o Added conversion from 'sf' to linear network class 'linnet'.

NEW FUNCTIONS

    o as.linnet.sf, as.linnet.sfc
    Convert 'sf' or 'sfc' object representing a list of lines,
    to a 'linnet' object representing a network.

        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-5

OVERVIEW

    o Changed package dependencies.


        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-4

OVERVIEW

    o Changed package dependencies.



        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-3

OVERVIEW

    o Changed package dependencies.


        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-2

OVERVIEW

    o Changed package internals.


        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-1

OVERVIEW

    o Added many methods.

NEW FUNCTIONS

    o as.im.SpatialGridDataFrame
    Convert pixel image from 'SpatialGridDataFrame' to 'im'
    
    o as.SpatialGridDataFrame.im
    Convert pixel image from 'im' to 'SpatialGridDataFrame'

    o as.SpatialLines.psp
    Convert line segment pattern from 'psp' to 'SpatialLines'

    o as.psp.SpatialLines
    Convert 'SpatialLines' to line segment pattern 'psp' 

    o as.psp.SpatialLinesDataFrame
    Convert 'SpatialLinesDataFrame' to line segment pattern 'psp' 

    o as.linnet.SpatialLinesDataFrame
    Convert 'SpatialLinesDataFrame' to linear network 'linnet'

    o as.owin.SpatialPolygons
    Convert 'SpatialPolygons' to 'owin'
    
    o as.owin.SpatialGridDataFrame
    Convert raster region from 'SpatialGridDataFrame' to 'owin'

    o as.owin.SpatialPixelsDataFrame
    Convert raster region from 'SpatialPixelsDataFrame' to 'owin'

    o as.SpatialPolygons.tess
    Convert the list of tiles of a tessellation to a SpatialPolygons object.

    o as.SpatialPolygons.owin
    Convert 'owin' to 'SpatialPolygons' object.

    o as.SpatialGridDataFrame.owin
    Convert 'owin' to 'SpatialGridDataFrame' object.

    o as.ppp.SpatialPoints
    Convert point pattern 'SpatialPoints' to 'ppp'    

    o as.ppp.SpatialPointsDataFrame
    Convert point pattern 'SpatialPointsDataFrame' to 'ppp'    

    o as.SpatialPoints.ppp
    Convert point pattern 'ppp' to 'SpatialPoints'

    o as.SpatialPointsDataFrame.ppp
    Convert point pattern 'ppp' to 'SpatialPointsDataFrame'

    o as.SpatialGridDataFrame.ppp
    Convert point pattern 'ppp' to 'SpatialGridDataFrame'

        CHANGES IN spatstat.convert VERSION 0.0-0

OVERVIEW

    o Package initialised.

NEW FUNCTIONS

    o as.im.SpatRaster
    Convert pixel image in 'terra' format 'SpatRaster' to 'spatstat' format 'im'

    o as.ppp.sf
    Convert point pattern in 'sf' format to 'spatstat' format 'ppp'.
    
